      "text": "那豈不是連 iPad 都能寫？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0005_A.mp3",
      "start": 13.252,
      "end": 15.964
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，而且每月有免費配額。免費。那肯定沒多少吧。",
      "terms": [
