      "start": 27.94,
      "end": 30.868
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "免得配額被白白吃掉。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0010_B.mp3",
      "start": 30.988,
      "end": 33.316
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "本機開發竟然有四條路？哪條適合我？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0011_A.mp3",
      "start": 33.436,
      "end": 37.636
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "四種選擇，看你的需求。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0012_B.mp3",
      "start": 37.756,
      "end": 40.492
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "最快的是哪條。原生 Python，裝個虛擬環境。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "虛擬環境",
          "en": "Virtual Environment",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/00-course-setup/02-setup-local.md:3"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0013_B.mp3",
      "start": 40.612,
      "end": 45.388
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那開發容器是什麼？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0014_A.mp3",
      "start": 45.508,
      "end": 47.716
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "用 Docker 建一個統一環境。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "開發容器",
          "en": "Dev Container",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/00-course-setup/02-setup-local.md:6"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0015_B.mp3",
      "start": 47.836,
      "end": 50.62
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "感覺有點複雜，有簡單的嗎？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0016_A.mp3",
      "start": 50.74,
      "end": 53.572
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Miniconda 用環境檔管理套件。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "環境檔",
          "en": "environment.yml",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/00-course-setup/02-setup-local.md:9"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0017_B.mp3",
      "start": 53.692,
      "end": 56.764
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那 Jupyter 呢？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0018_A.mp3",
      "start": 56.884,
      "end": 58.66
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "瀏覽器裡跑筆記本，適合探索。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "Jupyter",
          "en": "Jupyter",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/00-course-setup/README.md:1"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0019_B.mp3",
      "start": 58.78,
      "end": 62.092
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "我還是用原生 Python 好了。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0020_B.mp3",
      "start": 62.212,
      "end": 64.828
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "等等，金鑰直接寫在程式碼裡會怎樣？",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "API 金鑰",
          "en": "API Key",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/00-course-setup/02-setup-local.md:3"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0021_A.mp3",
      "start": 64.948,
      "end": 68.38
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "要是推到公開倉庫，等於把家門鑰匙交給陌生人。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0022_B.mp3",
      "start": 68.5,
      "end": 72.964
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "那不就等著被偷用，荷包大失血。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0023_B.mp3",
      "start": 73.084,
      "end": 76.372
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "對，輕則帳單爆漲，重則被拿去做壞事。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0024_A.mp3",
      "start": 76.492,
      "end": 80.356
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "所以要用 .env 檔，把金鑰藏在裡面。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "環境變數",
          "en": "Environment Variable",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/00-course-setup/02-setup-local.md:3"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0025_B.mp3",
      "start": 80.476,
      "end": 84.388
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "藏起來就沒事了。Git 會追蹤它嗎。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0026_B.mp3",
      "start": 84.508,
      "end": 88.3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "不會，.env 預設被忽略，別人看不到秘密。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0027_A.mp3",
      "start": 88.42,
      "end": 92.476
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "那程式怎麼讀到金鑰。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0028_B.mp3",
      "start": 92.596,
      "end": 95.164
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "用 python-dotenv，一行指令載入變數。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "python-dotenv",
          "en": "python-dotenv",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/00-course-setup/02-setup-local.md:3"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0029_B.mp3",
      "start": 95.284,
      "end": 98.86
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "先 pip install，再在程式裡呼叫它。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0030_A.mp3",
      "start": 98.98,
      "end": 102.508
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "這樣金鑰就不會出現在程式碼裡了。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0031_B.mp3",
      "start": 102.628,
      "end": 105.916
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "這麼多供應商，該選哪一家。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0032_B.mp3",
      "start": 106.036,
      "end": 109.012
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "模型能力有差，成本也不同。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0033_A.mp3",
      "start": 109.132,
      "end": 112.06
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "呃…不是都叫大型語言模型。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "大型語言模型",
          "en": "Large Language Model",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:1"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0034_B.mp3",
      "start": 112.18,
      "end": 115.276
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "能力有差，成本跟複雜度也不同。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0035_B.mp3",
      "start": 115.396,
      "end": 118.828
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "要比較任務質量、延遲這些指標。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0036_A.mp3",
      "start": 118.948,
      "end": 122.212
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "那豈不是要自己架伺服器。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0037_B.mp3",
      "start": 122.332,
      "end": 124.828
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "有託管端點，像 OpenAI、",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "託管端點",
          "en": "Managed Endpoint",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/00-course-setup/03-providers.md:2"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0038_B.mp3",
      "start": 124.948,
      "end": 127.924
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Azure 幫你管好。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0039_A.mp3",
      "start": 128.044,
      "end": 130.036
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Hugging Face 開放權重，也能自己部署。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0040_B.mp3",
      "start": 130.156,
      "end": 133.54
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "自己部署。那不是很麻煩。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0041_B.mp3",
      "start": 133.66,
      "end": 136.732
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Microsoft Foundry 有",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0042_A.mp3",
      "start": 136.852,
      "end": 138.988
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "模型目錄可比較。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_genai_course_setup_line0043_B.mp3",
      "start": 139.108,
      "end": 141.196
    },
